<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>星盤 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E6%98%9F%E7%9B%A4/</link><description>Recent content in 星盤 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E6%98%9F%E7%9B%A4/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>第一宮與第七宮怎麼看？從自我走向合作</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%AE%E8%88%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%AE%AE%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B%E5%BE%9E%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E8%B5%B0%E5%90%91%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C/</link><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%AE%E8%88%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%AE%AE%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B%E5%BE%9E%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E8%B5%B0%E5%90%91%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;讀星盤時，第一宮和第七宮落在兩端，常被簡化成「我」與「另一半」。如果你正在準備合作，這條軸線更有用的問法是：我怎麼開始一件事？又希望怎麼與人協調？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>星盤十二宮位怎麼看？先分清行星、星座與宮位</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%98%9F%E7%9B%A4%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%AE%E4%BD%8D%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B%E5%85%88%E5%88%86%E6%B8%85%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%9F%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%88%87%E5%AE%AE%E4%BD%8D/</link><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%98%9F%E7%9B%A4%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%AE%E4%BD%8D%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B%E5%85%88%E5%88%86%E6%B8%85%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%9F%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%88%87%E5%AE%AE%E4%BD%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;打開星盤後，先看到一圈符號，接著是密密麻麻的線；「第七宮有行星」究竟是在說什麼？讀宮位前，先把&lt;strong&gt;行星、星座、宮位&lt;/strong&gt;分開，你才不會把三種資訊揉成一句籠統的判斷。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>